{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1000_p", "source_sha256": "156dc5818990876b2301186d414cdc159864ffcb5bf6e0ccf85528306f46c575", "ja": "（今日は朋花の撮影に付き添っている。\n朋花は、悪名高い大海賊団の隊長役だ……）", "zh": "（今天陪朋花来拍摄。朋花饰演的是恶名昭彰的大海盗团船长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "cbcba7901fc51959f582fda5eab09fd5975616446d05a32fbef82fe8adccff39", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です～。\n私の隊長役、いかがでしたか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～。\n我饰演的队长感觉怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1002_p", "source_sha256": "87704b6f8f29a00bd3d5fd5c8e0bc8b8a3bd4465f1c38faadeedd95e48a9136f", "ja": "お疲れ様。さすがというか、すごい迫力だったよ。\n朋花の持つ威厳と、うまくマッチしてたな。", "zh": "辛苦了。该说不愧是你吗，气势实在惊人。和朋花身上的威严很相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "c55c80b5c3b1cae0c93c7b440357d5429795de7b7b659327197ca541dc09e56e", "ja": "ふふ、それは良かったです～。主人公に立ちはだかる\n女海賊として、役目を果たせたようですね～。", "zh": "呵呵，那就太好了～看来作为挡在主人公面前的女海盗，我顺利完成自己的任务了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "d9a9d93b3855c75d11f673871cc18403097b1419d94367d4856e9de6b9ec7e66", "ja": "用意していただいた小道具のムチも……。\nすぐに手に馴染んで、とても使いやすかったです～。", "zh": "您准备的道具皮鞭也……很快就顺手了，用起来非常方便～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1005_p", "source_sha256": "10b69706e1fbee428a1bd3fadb509aecba42c731d7be57515266bf08a6a3f0ca", "ja": "それはよかった。\n普段から使ってるような馴染み具合だったな！", "zh": "那就好。熟练得简直像平时一直在用一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "8a92ae190d418b3472b365013f04a5d07a31f06b5acc0bd754c7a49799fd1734", "ja": "……{$P$}さん～？\n今、何か言いましたか～？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生～？\n刚刚，您说了什么吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d2027c2a5e6c4498f30963de6689b21bd89f0637530645783a3e59003876d2fb", "ja": "い、いえ。何も……。", "zh": "没、没什么。什么都没……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "a48bac5d6bbbb7ba688552edf02119548ef330c69a8aa428a2c53775964fb428", "ja": "それならいいんですよ～。道具なんてなくても、\nムチの使い方くらい、ちゃんと心得ていますから。", "zh": "那就好啦～。就算没有道具，\n鞭子的用法我还是很清楚的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "261f78396c4b6c710af81453db85b7f33a501edd6215eb0834ef0b0b6063e3b2", "ja": "{$P$}さんが情けない言動をすれば\n私がビシバシ気合いを入れてあげますね～？　ふふ。", "zh": "要是{$P$}先生说了什么窝囊话，做了什么窝囊事，\n我会狠狠地替您好好打打气的～？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0392_1010_p", "source_sha256": "763c1d2ae2ad24f7f06e1ad1a061cb5ce4a8f45c1e108665085f5620ae45b99b", "ja": "（無邪気な笑顔から何やら不穏な気配を感じる……。\nムチの出番がないよう、気を引き締めよう……！）", "zh": "（从她天真无邪的笑容中，感受到了一丝不祥的气息……为了不让鞭子派上用场，我得打起精神来……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
